OL,5,G0100 Rescued Chimpanzees of the Congo
OL,6,G     with Jane Goodall
OL,7,     FDr. Rebeca Atencia rescues infant
OL,8,     Fchimp Zeze. He's not only lost an
OL,9,     Feye, but his mother too, both
OL,10,     Flikely caused by poachers hunting
OL,11,     Ffor bushmeat.
OL,12,G0200 Rescued Chimpanzees of the Congo
OL,13,G     with Jane Goodall
OL,14,     FInfant chimp Motambo is suffering
OL,15,     Ffrom tetanus and prescribed
OL,16,     Fantibiotics. Dr Alexandra Rosati
OL,17,     Fexplains how good chimps are at
OL,18,     Fsolving problems.
