OL,5,G0300 Rescued Chimpanzees of the Congo
OL,6,G     with Jane Goodall
OL,7,     FWork is underway on three new
OL,8,     Fparadise islands that will house
OL,9,     Fover 100 chimps, while at the
OL,10,     Fsanctuary the baby group attend
OL,11,     Fforest school.
